<view class="customer-app">
  <view class="customer-hero"><view class="customer-brand">板上有雪 <text>BSR SKI RENTALS</text></view><view class="customer-title">今天，滑个痛快。<view>装备交给我们。</view></view><view class="customer-sub">{{demo ? '本机演示 · 虚构数据' : '门店装备 · 云端同步'}} · 到店选配，专业交付</view><view class="mountain">△<text>╱</text>△</view></view>
  <view class="customer-tabs"><view class="{{tab === 'browse' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="browse" bindtap="tab">挑选装备</view><view class="{{tab === 'booking' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="booking" bindtap="tab">预约清单 {{selected.length}}</view><view class="{{tab === 'records' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="records" bindtap="tab">我的记录</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="customer-error">{{error}}<button size="mini" bindtap="retry">重新连接</button><button wx:if="{{!demo}}" size="mini" data-demo="true" bindtap="switchMode">体验本机演示</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="mode-notice">本机演示 · 使用虚构数据，不会同步网页后台<button size="mini" data-demo="false" bindtap="switchMode">切回云端</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="customer-empty">正在同步门店记录…</view>
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'browse' && stores.length}}">
    <view class="customer-location"><picker range="{{stores}}" range-key="name" value="{{storeIndex}}" bindchange="store">⌖ {{storeName || '选择门店'}} ▾</picker><text>当前可租装备</text></view>
    <view class="catalog-search"><text>⌕</text><input value="{{search}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索装备名称、编号或规格" confirm-type="search"/></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="customer-categories"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="category-chip {{category === item ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-name="{{item}}" bindtap="category">{{item}}</view></scroll-view>
    <view class="customer-grid"><view wx:for="{{equipment}}" wx:key="id" class="customer-equipment"><view class="equipment-art"><text>{{item.category === '头盔' ? '◠' : item.category === '雪靴' ? '▰' : '╱╱'}}</text><view>#{{item.id}}</view></view><view class="equipment-copy"><text class="equipment-category">{{item.category}} {{item.level}}</text><view class="equipment-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="customer-muted">{{item.spec}}</view><view class="customer-price">¥{{item.price}}<text>/天</text></view><button class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose">{{item.selected ? '✓ 已加入清单' : '＋ 加入清单'}}</button></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!equipment.length && !loading}}" class="customer-empty">没有找到匹配的装备，可换个关键词、类别或门店。</view>
    <view class="customer-footnote">预约仅提交租赁意向，不锁定库存、不在线付款。到店后员工会重新核对装备、适配检查、线下签署与外部付款凭据，再以正式合同确认交付。</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'booking'}}"><view class="customer-card"><view class="customer-heading">你的雪场装备单</view><view wx:for="{{basket}}" wx:key="id" class="booking-item"><view>{{item.name}} #{{item.id}}<view class="customer-muted">{{item.spec}}</view></view><view class="basket-right"><text>¥{{item.price}}/天</text><text class="remove-item" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose">移出清单</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!basket.length}}" class="customer-empty">先去挑选一件装备吧<button class="empty-action" data-id="browse" bindtap="tab">去挑选装备</button></view><view class="form-section-title">01 · 到店安排</view><view class="customer-field">取件门店<view>{{storeName}}</view></view><view class="customer-field">预计取件日期<picker mode="date" value="{{form.startDate}}" start="{{today}}" data-key="startDate" bindchange="input"><view class="customer-input">{{form.startDate}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="customer-field">租赁天数<input class="customer-input" type="number" value="{{days}}" bindinput="days"/></view><view class="estimated-date" wx:if="{{returnDate}}">预计归还 {{returnDate}}<text>取件当天计为第 1 天，以门店最终确认安排为准</text></view><view class="form-section-title">02 · 联系与技能</view><view class="customer-field">姓名<input class="customer-input" value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="请使用教学演示姓名" maxlength="40"/></view><view class="customer-field">联系电话<input class="customer-input" value="{{form.phone}}" data-key="phone" bindinput="input" placeholder="门店用于联系确认" maxlength="40"/></view><view class="customer-field">邮箱<input class="customer-input" value="{{form.email}}" data-key="email" bindinput="input" placeholder="用于到店资料核对" maxlength="100"/></view><view class="customer-field">当前技能<picker range="{{levels}}" value="{{levelIndex}}" bindchange="level"><view class="customer-input">{{form.level}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="customer-field">备注<input class="customer-input" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input" placeholder="选填，例如偏好或到店时间" maxlength="200"/></view><view class="form-section-title">03 · 核对并提交</view><view class="customer-consent"><switch color="#167b6c" checked="{{form.consent}}" bindchange="consent"/><text>同意门店为确认此次预约使用所填联系资料；课堂演示请使用虚构信息。</text></view><view class="booking-total">参考合计 <text>¥{{total}}</text></view><button class="customer-submit" disabled="{{saving || !basket.length}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="submit">提交预约 · 等待门店确认</button></view></block>
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'records'}}"><view class="records-intro"><view>下一次出发，安排好了吗？</view><text>{{recordCount}} 份预约等待到店办理 · 随时查看门店处理状态</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="customer-categories record-filters"><view wx:for="{{recordFilters}}" wx:key="*this" class="category-chip {{recordFilter === item ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-name="{{item}}" bindtap="recordFilter">{{item}}</view></scroll-view><view class="customer-section"><text class="customer-heading">预约记录</text><text bindtap="records">刷新</text></view><view wx:for="{{visibleRecords}}" wx:key="id" class="customer-card"><view class="customer-section"><text>{{item.id}}</text><text class="customer-tag {{item.status === '待确认' ? 'pending' : item.status === '已取消' || item.status === '已关闭' ? 'inactive' : ''}}">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="customer-heading">{{item.storeName}} · {{item.startDate}}</view><view class="customer-muted">{{item.days}}天 · {{item.items.length}}件装备 · 参考 ¥{{item.amount}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:key="equipmentId" wx:for-item="piece" class="record-piece">{{piece.name}} #{{piece.equipmentId}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === '待确认'}}" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="cancel">取消预约</button><view wx:if="{{item.contractId}}" class="customer-muted">已生成租赁合同 {{item.contractId}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!visibleRecords.length && !loading}}" class="customer-empty">当前条件下暂无预约记录</view><view class="customer-section"><text class="customer-heading">已关联租赁合同</text></view><view wx:for="{{contracts}}" wx:key="id" class="customer-card"><view class="customer-section"><text>{{item.id}}</text><text class="customer-tag {{item.status === '待确认' ? 'pending' : item.status === '已取消' || item.status === '已关闭' ? 'inactive' : ''}}">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="customer-heading">合同合计 ¥{{item.amount}}</view><view class="customer-muted">{{item.storeName}} · {{item.activeCount}} 件租用中</view><view class="estimated-date" wx:if="{{item.dueDate && item.activeCount}}">预计归还 {{item.dueDate}}<text>需要调整或跨店归还，请联系门店确认</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="piece" class="record-piece">{{piece.name}} #{{piece.equipmentId}} · {{piece.returnAt ? '已归还' : '租用中'}}</view></view><view class="customer-footnote">仅显示当前微信身份提交的预约及由该预约开立的合同；历史线下合同需门店核对后关联。</view></block>
<view class="basket-dock" wx:if="{{tab === 'browse' && basket.length}}"><view><text class="dock-title">已选 {{basket.length}} 件</text><text>参考 ¥{{total}} / {{days}} 天</text></view><button data-id="booking" bindtap="tab">查看预约清单 →</button></view>
</view>
